[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/2402971877","html_url":"https://github.com/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/2583#issuecomment-2402971877","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/2583","id":2402971877,"node_id":"IC_kwDOA0JFE86POnDl","user":{"login":"robert-scheck","id":10982488,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwOTgyNDg4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/10982488?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/robert-scheck","html_url":"https://github.com/robert-scheck","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/robert-scheck/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/robert-scheck/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/robert-scheck/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/robert-scheck/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/robert-scheck/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/robert-scheck/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/robert-scheck/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/robert-scheck/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/robert-scheck/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-10-09T18:10:41Z","updated_at":"2024-10-09T18:39:28Z","body":"Honestly, I don't know what the license name is (or should be) nor what a proper short identifier would be, given libtelnet upstream calls this \"Public Domain\" while @richardfontana referred to a derivative of Unlicense.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/2402971877/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/2403001932","html_url":"https://github.com/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/2583#issuecomment-2403001932","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/2583","id":2403001932,"node_id":"IC_kwDOA0JFE86POuZM","user":{"login":"richardfontana","id":1179636,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjExNzk2MzY=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1179636?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/richardfontana","html_url":"https://github.com/richardfontana","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/richardfontana/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/richardfontana/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/richardfontana/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/richardfontana/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/richardfontana/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/richardfontana/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/richardfontana/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/richardfontana/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/richardfontana/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-10-09T18:27:06Z","updated_at":"2024-10-09T18:27:06Z","body":"To elaborate a bit, as I think SPDX-legal knows, Fedora has been using an umbrella LicenseRef to represent all sorts of bespoke public domain dedications, but has also been using existing SPDX identifiers for \"standardized\" instruments that are, essentially, public domain dedications or approximations thereof, as in the case of the Unlicense. In this case, we have a project that has made some minor textual changes to one paragraph of `Unlicense`, so we are wondering whether SPDX would want to assign an identifier for it much as it has given an identifier for the Unlicense itself. ","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/2403001932/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/2410872558","html_url":"https://github.com/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/2583#issuecomment-2410872558","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/2583","id":2410872558,"node_id":"IC_kwDOA0JFE86Psv7u","user":{"login":"xsuchy","id":85769,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg1NzY5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/85769?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/xsuchy","html_url":"https://github.com/xsuchy","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xsuchy/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xsuchy/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xsuchy/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xsuchy/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xsuchy/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xsuchy/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xsuchy/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xsuchy/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xsuchy/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-10-14T11:03:11Z","updated_at":"2024-10-14T11:03:11Z","body":"Full text of license:\r\n```\r\nlibtelnet is released to the public domain:\r\n\r\nThe author or authors of this code dedicate any and all copyright\r\ninterest in this code to the public domain. We make this dedication\r\nfor the benefit of the public at large and to the detriment of our\r\nheirs and successors. We intend this dedication to be an overt act of\r\nrelinquishment in perpetuity of all present and future rights to this\r\ncode under copyright law.\r\n```","author_association":"COLLABORATOR","pin":null,"react