NSE)\r\nOSI status: _none_\r\n\r\n**ScanCode**\r\nmatched id: [public-domain](https://github.com/nexB/scancode-toolkit/blob/develop/src/licensedcode/data/licenses/public-domain.LICENSE)\r\n\r\n**Comment**\r\nUnsure. General topic. How does SPDX represent Public Domain as a concept?","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/2580928741/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/2617120333","html_url":"https://github.com/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/2583#issuecomment-2617120333","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/2583","id":2617120333,"node_id":"IC_kwDOA0JFE86b_hZN","user":{"login":"jlovejoy","id":5048659,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUwNDg2NTk=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5048659?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy","html_url":"https://github.com/jlovejoy","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-01-27T23:25:13Z","updated_at":"2025-01-27T23:25:13Z","body":"@karsten-klein - SPDX does not represent Public Domain as a concept as per [this guidance from some time ago](https://github.com/spdx/old-wiki/blob/bc090650c9bc9f59e77fa8bfc486158b0830fbde/Pages/Legal%20Team/Decisions/Dealing%20with%20Public%20Domain%20within%20SPDX%20Files.md)\n\nDue to a large number of very short (e.g., a few words) public domain \"dedications\" found in Fedora, Fedora has been using one LicenseRef identifier to refer to a collection of texts (which are stored in the Fedora-license-list repo)","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/2617120333/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/2632566765","html_url":"https://github.com/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/2583#issuecomment-2632566765","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/2583","id":2632566765,"node_id":"IC_kwDOA0JFE86c6cft","user":{"login":"Pizza-Ria","id":46799628,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ2Nzk5NjI4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/46799628?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Pizza-Ria","html_url":"https://github.com/Pizza-Ria","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Pizza-Ria/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Pizza-Ria/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Pizza-Ria/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Pizza-Ria/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Pizza-Ria/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Pizza-Ria/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Pizza-Ria/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Pizza-Ria/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Pizza-Ria/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-02-04T01:40:14Z","updated_at":"2025-02-04T01:40:14Z","body":"@richardfontana following up on your statement \"Fedora has been using an umbrella LicenseRef to represent all sorts of bespoke public domain dedications.\"  If we grant an SPDX ID to this one, does that open the door to granting an SPDX ID to all the bespoke public domain dedications in Fedora?  Or is it just that this one is a subset of the existing UnLicense?  If former, I'm ambivalent (leaning disinclined).  If the latter, then I'm OK with something like Unlicense-Shortened.  I don't like either of the two names proferred ... Unlicense-Third-Paragraph because I don't have the license texts memorized that I feel clued in by this title and the second name for the potential legal assertion with a loaded term like \"Public Domain\".  ","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/2632566765/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/2675583953","html_url":"https://github.com/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/2583#issuecomment-2675583953","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/2583","id":2675583953,"node_id":"IC_kwDOA0JFE86feivR","user":{"login":"jlovejoy","id":5048659,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUwNDg2NTk=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5048659?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy","html_url":"https://github.com/jlovejoy","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-02-21T21:31:16Z","updated_at":"2025-02-21T21:31:16Z","body":"@Pizza-Ria - whether SPDX adds this as a new license or not, doesn't have bearing on Fedora other than which SPDX id Fedora will use to represent this text. So, no opening of doors as you noted above.\n\nI'm not sure if this is a subset of the Unlicense or just sort of \"borrows\" some of the same text. The question then is as to the ID, should we even use \"Unlicense\" in it at all? (and then what about the other similar issue)?\n\nseems like there is support to add it tho?","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/2675583953/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/2675853621","html_url":"https://github.com/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/2583#issuecomment-2675853621","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/2583","id":2675853621,"node_id":"IC_kwDOA0JFE86ffkk1","user":{"login":"robert-scheck","id":10982488,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwOTgyNDg4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/10982488?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/robert-scheck","html_url":"https://github.com/robert-scheck","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/robert-scheck/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/robert-scheck/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/robert-scheck/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"http